repository-code: "https://github.com/xiwenHu/jakstat-mdd-gradient"
abstract: >-
  Code, derived result tables and figures demonstrating that reported
  transcriptomic-imaging convergence of JAK-STAT signaling in major
  depressive disorder is accounted for by the cortical principal gradient.
  Convergent nulls across spatial, genetic and postmortem layers, with
  schizophrenia positive controls and Bayes factors.
keywords:
  - imaging transcriptomics
  - cortical principal gradient
  - major depressive disorder
  - JAK-STAT
  - null models
  - Bayes factor
